This embroidery font  is licensed CC-BY-NC-SA4 .0 (http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/).


This font uses an old cross-stitch chart from the book  "Toilette Present for Ladies", published in the United States circa 1850.

Scans of this book are found at https://www.antiquepatternlibrary.org/pub/PDF/NeedleworkCopieRecharted.pdf where they are shared under the Creative Commons Licence CC-BY-NC-SA 4.0

